//! `ComplexScalar`; f64 and Complex64). GENERATED by tools/gen-blas-trait-harness.py (do not edit); 0 of the 259 cases faulted before any fix. Every vector is strided (`inc` = 2) and every
//! matrix has a padded leading dimension (`minor + 1`), in both layouts; the CONTROL passes exactly `(n - 1) * inc + 1` / `(major - 1) * ld + minor`
//! elements, each short case passes ONE buffer one element short at the end of a committed page before a PAGE_NOACCESS page (a fault = HOLE).
//! One process per test (tools/safe-api-harness.py). Windows only; Linux unmeasured.
#![cfg(windows)]
